	measure 'Customer Pareto %' = ```
			
			VAR runningRev = CALCULATE ( [Total Sales], TOPN ( [Customer Rank], ALL ( Customer ), [Total Sales], DESC ) ) 
			VAR grandTotal = CALCULATE ( [Total Sales], ALL ( Customer ) ) 
			RETURN DIVIDE ( runningRev, grandTotal )
			
			```
